# Keep the committed Yarn release out of the Composer dist archive. Composer
# downloads dist packages through GitHub's archive API, which honours
# export-ignore, so consumers of convertcom/php-sdk never receive this path.
#
# .yarn/releases holds the pinned Yarn 4 binary (~3.6 MB) that .yarnrc.yml
# points yarnPath at. It exists so this repo's own CI installs a reproducible
# dependency tree, and is of no use to anyone installing the SDK.
#
# Scoped deliberately to .yarn/ only — excluding anything else from the dist
# archive would change what consumers receive, which is out of scope here.
.yarn/ export-ignore
